[
  {
    "content_id": "10057001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;为基督耶稣被囚的保罗，同兄弟提摩太写信给我们所亲爱的同工腓利门，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;和妹子亚腓亚并与我们同当兵的亚基布，以及在你家的教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;愿恩惠、平安从　神我们的父和主耶稣基督归与你们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我祷告的时候提到你，常为你感谢我的　神；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因听说你的爱心并你向主耶稣和众圣徒的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;愿你与人所同有的信心显出功效，使人知道你们各样善事都是为基督做的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;兄弟啊，我为你的爱心，大有快乐，大得安慰，因众圣徒的心从你得了畅快。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我虽然靠着基督能放胆吩咐你合宜的事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;然而像我这有年纪的保罗，现在又是为基督耶稣被囚的，宁可凭着爱心求你，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;就是为我在捆锁中所生的儿子阿尼西谋求你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他从前与你没有益处，但如今与你我都有益处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我现在打发他亲自回你那里去；他是我心上的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我本来有意将他留下，在我为福音所受的捆锁中替你伺候我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但不知道你的意思，我就不愿意这样行，叫你的善行不是出于勉强，乃是出于甘心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他暂时离开你，或者是叫你永远得着他，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;不再是奴仆，乃是高过奴仆，是亲爱的兄弟。在我实在是如此，何况在你呢！这也不拘是按肉体说，是按主说。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你若以我为同伴，就收纳他，如同收纳我一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他若亏负你，或欠你什么，都归在我的帐上；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我必偿还，这是我—保罗亲笔写的。我并不用对你说，连你自己也是亏欠于我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;兄弟啊，望你使我在主里因你得快乐，并望你使我的心在基督里得畅快。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我写信给你，深信你必顺服，知道你所要行的必过于我所说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;此外你还要给我预备住处；因为我盼望借着你们的祷告，必蒙恩到你们那里去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;为基督耶稣与我同坐监的以巴弗问你安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;与我同工的马可、亚里达古、底马、路加也都问你安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10057001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓利门书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "57001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;愿我们主耶稣基督的恩常在你的心里。阿们！</p>"
  }
]